<title>LITHUANIA: SOCCER-LITHUANIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LITHUANIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
